# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Demo request delivery
#
# The site ships to Vercel and as a static export for cPanel. The static
# build cannot run server code, so demo requests POST to a hosted form
# endpoint that forwards them to:
#     James@aurilearn.ai, Arjun@aurilearn.ai, Rashmi@aurilearn.ai,
#     vijay@aurilearn.ai
#
# Set these in Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) and in
# a local .env.local. Until the endpoint is set, the form shows an error
# with a direct mailto fallback rather than pretending it sent.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTIONAL. The code already defaults to https://formsubmit.co/ajax, so a
# production build works without any env file. Set this only to override,
# for example to point a local build at a test endpoint.
#
# The POST url given by the form provider.
#
# FormSubmit is the one that reaches all four people on a free plan — it
# takes a comma separated `_cc` list, which the code already sends. The
# url carries the PRIMARY recipient; the other three are copied in.
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax
#
# Set the BASE url only — the code appends each recipient, posting once
# per person so everyone gets their own direct email and nobody is CC'd.
#
# The first request to each address triggers a one-time confirmation
# email to that person. Each of the four clicks their link once, then
# delivery is automatic.
#
# Note: Web3Forms free delivers to ONE address only; its CC is a paid
# feature. Do not use it here unless a forwarding alias exists.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Only needed if the provider issues an access key (FormSubmit does not)
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_FORM_ACCESS_KEY=
